  "$comment": "Single source of truth for file typing. Read by notecode.exe (to pick the editor mode) AND by runtime/notecode-mcp.mjs (so the AI resolves 'save as markdown' to .md the same way). Adding a language means adding one line here plus the CodeMirror mode file.",

